# Reference Point — Feature Footer Copy (`p.copy` in `.cert-feature-foot`)

When the user says **"reference point"** for main-feature footer column copy (e.g. "Turns opaque lab marks into plain language…"), match `p.copy` inside `.cert-feature-foot .col`.

## Structure

```html
<footer class="cert-feature-foot">
  <div class="col">
    <p class="label">About the feature</p>
    <p class="copy">Turns opaque lab marks into plain language so buyers can verify authenticity without leaving the page.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <p class="label">How it helps</p>
    <p class="copy">Third-party IGI proof replaces seller claims — certificate number, metal, and finish decoded in context.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <p class="label">Trade offs</p>
    <p class="copy">Adds a step before checkout; worth it when a high-value purchase needs proof, not just a badge.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
```

Place below a scaled feature block (`.cert-feature`, `.to-feature`, `.vault-feature`).

## Visual spec — `.copy`

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Element | `p.copy` inside `.cert-feature-foot .col` |
| Font | `var(--ui-sans)` |
| Size | `14px` |
| Weight | `500` |
| Color | `#6a6158` |
| Line-height | `1.45` |
| Margin | `0` |

## Footer stack (per column)

1. `.label` — rose-brown uppercase label (`11px`, weight 700, `#a68985`, `0.12em` tracking)
2. **`p.copy`** — grey supporting copy ← this reference

## Footer grid

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Wrapper | `.cert-feature-foot` |
| Layout | 3-column grid, `gap: 28px`, `margin-top: 28px`, `padding: 0 12px` |
| Column | `.col` — column flex, `gap: 8px` |

## vs other copy styles

| Class | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `p.copy` in `.cert-feature-foot` | Feature footer column body — UI sans, `14px`, `#6a6158` |
| `p.copy` in `.story-duo .is-solution` | Canvas annotation design solution — same UI sans, `14px`, `#6a6158` |
| `.lead` | Section/column intro — grey sans, `var(--body)` or `var(--lead)` |
| `.disc-card-head .friction` | Card friction line — grey sans, `var(--body)` |
| `.body` | Secondary muted copy — `var(--muted-2)` |

## Do not

- Use `.lead` directly when this compact footer copy size is the reference.
- Use serif, italic, or dark ink (`var(--ink-deep)`) for footer `.copy`.
- Inline size/color overrides unless the user explicitly asks.
